id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45938::$$$message_0443_0000_0000$$$::"...Think you got the gist of the game now?"::
45939::$$$message_0443_0000_0001$$$::"One last bit of advice, then..."::
45940::$$$message_0443_0000_0002$$$::"Repeat after me: memorizing the cards that build hands is the surest path to victory."::
45941::$$$message_0443_0000_0003$$$::"'Memorize the hands and cards.'"::
45942::$$$message_0443_0000_0004$$$::"Next, prioritize acquiring the cards that make the hands you want."::
45943::$$$message_0443_0000_0005$$$::"'Prioritize cards that make hands.'"::
45944::$$$message_0443_0000_0006$$$::"As you get used to the game, you'll be able to tell what hands your opponent can build when they acquire cards."::
45945::$$$message_0443_0000_0007$$$::"It can be effective to try and prevent them from doing so. [wvl][hfsigh layer=2]Basically, take the cards that can build hands before your opponent does."::
45946::$$$message_0443_0000_0008$$$::"'Stop your opponent from making hands.'"::
45947::$$$message_0443_0000_0009$$$::"Don't just rely on luck. Take a good look at your hand and the field before you move and consider what hands you want to build."::
45948::$$$message_0443_0000_0010$$$::"'Wait for a chance to build a hand.'"::
45949::$$$message_0443_0000_0011$$$::"There are tactics other than building individual hands, too. You can try to win with a few points at a time, or go for big bonuses."::
45950::$$$message_0443_0000_0012$$$::"Your opponent has access to Noble Phantasms, too. They could stop you from getting the specific hand you want."::
45951::$$$message_0443_0000_0013$$$::"Do your best to take advantage of your opponent's weaknesses and adapt your tactics to the situation."::
45952::$$$message_0443_0000_0014$$$::"Thanks for your patience. [wvl][hffacechg2 chara=アサ子 face=喜 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfwww layer=2]That's all for this tutorial. Best of luck to you, lord mage."::
45953::$$$message_0443_0000_0015$$$::"Ciao!":W�